622
01:15:10.843 --> 01:15:12.678
Close your eyes.

623
01:15:13.888 --> 01:15:15.389
Keep them closed.

624
01:15:30.361 --> 01:15:32.363
Let's make a pact.

625
01:15:33.864 --> 01:15:36.283
It only hurts for a second.

626
01:15:38.118 --> 01:15:39.453
Here.

627
01:16:00.180 --> 01:16:01.848
